		(uuid "7a5733b3-aa36-5c58-a233-5cc36bec43dc")
	)
	(text "HOLD = B_HOLD (|I| >= 0.97-1.03 kA: contactor held). MOV_OK high while the varistor monitor loop conducts.\nPort over-current (387-413 A) pulls FLT_N low (open drain): the latch trips without firmware."
